sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-murray-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-repro-package> .
